desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Insecure Random"
	title_zh: "Insecure Random"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-insecure-random"
	risk: "weak-randomness"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Flags the use of a predictable random value from `scala.util.Random`. This can lead to vulnerabilities when used in security contexts, such as in a CSRF token, password reset token, or any other secret value. To fix this, use java.security.SecureRandom instead.

### 风险类型
弱随机数（weak-randomness）

### 影响
使用不安全的伪随机数生成器，可能导致令牌、密钥或安全决策可预测。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-330: Use of Insufficiently Random Values
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用密码学安全的随机数生成器。

推荐修复：
To fix this, use java.security.SecureRandom instead.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.scala": <<<POS
import scala.util.Random
POS
	"safefile://pos.scala": <<<NEG
import scala.collection.mutable.ArrayBuffer
NEG
)

${*.scala}.pattern_regex(/(?:import\s+scala\.util\.Random)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Insecure Random",
	title_zh: "Insecure Random",
	message: "Insecure Random detected.",
}
